type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月中に叶いますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして8月は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11日、12日に北海道にお邪魔します✨もうすっごく楽しみです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に加入してから2回くらい行ったことがあるんですが、楽しかった思い出しかありません☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202207/mobSp0RTy.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年前、一人全国キャンペーンで行った時の思い出。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に回った場所が北海道の、今はやんちゃんがレギュラーをしているIMAREALだったんです✨懐かしいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202207/mobUDth6F.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくらも食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかった…今年も食べたいな…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は全国ツアーで、乃木坂みんなで行けることがすっごく嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出たっくさんつくるぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道の皆さん、よろしくお願いします🙇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/